    <title>Leetcode-144-Binary-Tree-Preorder</title>
    <link href="/leetcode-blog/2025/12/29/Leetcode-144-Binary-Tree-Preorder/"/>
    <url>/leetcode-blog/2025/12/29/Leetcode-144-Binary-Tree-Preorder/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="相似题目"><a href="#相似题目" class="headerlink" title="相似题目"></a>相似题目</h2><p>144 (preorder)、94 (inorder)、145 (postorder)</p><h2 id="🧠-思路总结"><a href="#🧠-思路总结" class="headerlink" title="🧠 思路总结"></a>🧠 思路总结</h2><ul><li>前序preorder遍历的固定顺序是 <strong>根 → 左 → 右</strong>。<br>inorder: <strong>左 → 根 → 右</strong><br>postorder: <strong>左 → 右 → 根</strong></li></ul><img src="/leetcode-blog/2025/12/29/Leetcode-144-Binary-Tree-Preorder/3.png" class=""><ul><li>preorder顺序图</li></ul><img src="/leetcode-blog/2025/12/29/Leetcode-144-Binary-Tree-Preorder/preorder.png" class=""><ul><li>三个order使用list</li></ul><img src="/leetcode-blog/2025/12/29/Leetcode-144-Binary-Tree-Preorder/listOrder.png" class=""><h2 id="❗-易错点-小坑"><a href="#❗-易错点-小坑" class="headerlink" title="❗ 易错点 &#x2F; 小坑"></a>❗ 易错点 &#x2F; 小坑</h2><ul><li>在递归函数内部 <strong>每次 new 一个 List</strong>，会导致之前的遍历结果被丢失</li><li>TreeNode 不是“树”，而是“节点”。树 &#x3D; 一堆 TreeNode 连起来</li><li>Base case: <code>root == null</code></li><li>为什么要判断<code>root == null</code>?  <ol><li>叶子节点的 left &#x2F; right 本来就是 null  </li><li>null 表示：这条路走到头了  </li><li>这是递归的 终止条件</li></ol></li></ul><h2 id="✅-代码（Java）"><a href="#✅-代码（Java）" class="headerlink" title="✅ 代码（Java）"></a>✅ 代码（Java）</h2><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs java"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Solution</span> &#123;<br>    List&lt;Integer&gt; res = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">ArrayList</span>&lt;&gt;();<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> List&lt;Integer&gt; <span class="hljs-title function_">preorderTraversal</span><span class="hljs-params">(TreeNode root)</span> &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (root == <span class="hljs-literal">null</span>) &#123;<br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> res;<br>        &#125;<br>        res.add(root.val);                 <span class="hljs-comment">// 根</span><br>        preorderTraversal(root.left);      <span class="hljs-comment">// 左</span><br>        preorderTraversal(root.right);     <span class="hljs-comment">// 右</span><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> res;<br>    &#125;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
